    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30281" root="علق" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِقٌ</span></b>  [part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِقَ</span>: as such signifying
<i>Hanging,</i> or <i>being suspended:</i> and <i>clinging,</i> &amp;c.:
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and] <i>pertinacious; adhering to affairs, and
minding them.</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذمر</span>.) [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَاقِيَةٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Also, as such, applied to a woman,
<i>Pregnant:</i> a meaning assigned by Golius to
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَقٌ</span>.]

